{#
  Body of the modal the hourglass (pending) and the check (done) of a campaign node open: the container of the contacts.
  The container has the data-target-url of the table (CampaignPendingContactsController); Mautic.campaignPendingOnLoad
  (CampaignPendingClickSubscriber) loads it when the modal opens, as the segment modal does for its Contacts tab. Core's
  shared modal is narrow by default, so only a modal holding this body is widened (:has), to 95% of the screen: the table
  has all the columns of the contact list. Variables: event, tableRoute (the route of the table: pending or done).
#}
<style>
    .modal-dialog:has(.mautic-patches-campaign-pending) {
        width: 95vw;
        max-width: 95vw;
    }
</style>
<div class="mautic-patches-campaign-pending">
    <div class="page-list" id="patches-pending-container"
         data-target-url="{{ path(tableRoute, {'objectId': event.id, 'page': 1}) }}">
        <div class="spinner"><i class="ri-loader-3-line ri-spin"></i></div>
    </div>
</div>
